### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8081/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 执行富集分析
POST http://localhost:8081/api/enrichment/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "genes": ["LOC126982165"],
  "analysisType": "GO"
}

### 获取结果（替换{taskId}）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/enrichment/results?taskId={taskId}
Accept: application/json
